  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">La Monarqu\u00eda Indiana de Carlos II en la encrujiada (2024), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 468 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">La Monarqu\u00eda Indiana de Carlos II en la encrujiada by Juan Jim\u00e9nez Castillo Jim\u00e9nez Castillo was published by Leuven University Press in 2024. Conceptually, the work connects to Humanities and Art.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 468 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Peace, Justice and strong institutions among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
